Assumptions: 1 contract = 1 x index; P&L on bid bars, one full spread charged per round trip at the hour used;
 swap charged per calendar night held (triple-Friday => calendar days); CFD longs receive dividend adjustments
 (Yahoo/MT5 prices are price indices except DAX = total-return index -> no div credit). For US indices the
 historical swap is modelled as markup + ^IRX T-bill rate; non-US use today's live swap (flag: their rates differ).

